R4: Uncertainty in the known gamma (draught)
run 20261126_170737, MATLAB 26.2.0.3386108 (R2026b), code commit 50db4e7, 1436 s

Setting: p0, Level 2C (ref s26), N = 65536, L = 2048, JONSWAP Hs 0.05 m, omega_p 5.0 rad/s.
Sensitivity per unit ln(gamma) error: d ln beta +0.0778, d ln R +0.00736 (lsm6dsv16x noise).
(earlier FRF-based estimate for comparison: 0.057 for beta, 0.008 for R; magnitudes)

DELIVERABLE: required accuracy of gamma (= relative accuracy of the draught) by first crossing
  noise case    sigma_lnb   |db/b|<=1%   d_sys<=0.5     d_sys<=1
  datasheet         0.02%       11.68%        0.12%        0.24%
